\" />\n\nJudging by your OS. Are you on an older Macbook by any chance? I wonder if this is an issue that only impacts older Intel Macbooks","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301305710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301359684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589#issuecomment-3301359684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110589","id":3301359684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ExsBE","user":{"login":"JesusRoberto64","id":40547350,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNTQ3MzUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40547350?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64","html_url":"https://github.com/JesusRoberto64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JesusRoberto64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T05:27:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T05:27:57Z","body":"Yes I'm using a older iMac late 2013, Catalina, 2.7 GHz Intel core i5 4 nucleous. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301359684/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301364717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589#issuecomment-3301364717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110589","id":3301364717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ExtPt","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T05:30:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T05:30:37Z","body":"I have good news! I was able to reproduce the issue on an early 2015 MBP running MacOS Monterey (12.6.1). It seems the regression originated in 4.5 dev3. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301364717/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301414765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589#issuecomment-3301414765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110589","id":3301414765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ex5dt","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T05:55:23Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T06:12:19Z","body":"More good news, I have tracked down the issue to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103306\n\nAs a workaround, you just need to go into your project settings and disable [`rendering/reflections/sky_reflections/texture_array_reflections`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-reflections-sky-reflections-texture-array-reflections) \n\nCC @bruvzg @Calinou If I reproduce the code changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103306 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105424 but apply them to all platforms, I can reproduce this issue on my Windows machine. So it seems that the code is just fundamentally broken\n\nThis is probably why. The shader code is generated before that line of code is run. So the shader still expects to use the texture array even if the other code doesn't. That leads the engine to read from garbage memory in the shader\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/adb2ec043ed61ea8451f2593171d7163303b7ba5/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/forward_mobile/render_forward_mobile.cpp#L3340-L3342\n\nI think the solution is to move the call to `check_cubemap_array()` into the constructors for `RenderForwardMobile` and `RenderForwardClustered`. Doing so on my Windows device fixes the issue. I'll test on the Intel Mac in the morning. Building will take too long to test tonight","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301414765/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303759209","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110589#issuecomment-3303759209","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110589","id":3303759209,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E611p","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T16:30:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T16:30:07Z","body":"> I think the solution is to move the call to `check_cubemap_array()` into the constructors for `RenderForwardMobile` and `RenderForwardClustered`.\n\nSounds good to me.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3303759209/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]